WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Can a 5-day oral pill keep high-risk Covid-19 patients out of hospital?

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.500
EPIC-HR randomized 2246 patients unvaccinated, high-risk outpatients.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.500
Hospitalization or death by day 28: 0.72% with nirmatrelvir plus ritonavir versus 6.45% with placebo.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.500
That is a relative risk reduction of 88.9%.

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.500
Deaths: 13 with placebo. None with nirmatrelvir plus ritonavir.

6
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.500
The trade-off: dysgeusia in 5.6% versus 0.3%.

7
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:39.500
Nirmatrelvir plus ritonavir cut hospitalization or death by about 89%. N Engl J Med, 2022. Scroll for the full breakdown.
